# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) only if you need to override a default.
# Nothing here is required: the site runs with the values in src/lib/.

# Google reviews on the home page come from the free Featurable API. The live
# widget ID is committed in src/lib/site.ts (it is public, same as the one in
# Featurable's embed snippets), so deploys need no configuration.
# Set this only to point the site at a DIFFERENT widget — a new one from
# https://featurable.com/app/widgets (Embed > API) — without editing code.
# FEATURABLE_WIDGET_ID=
